{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/01_개발환경세팅/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"1-다운로드\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 다운로드<a href=\"#1-%EB%8B%A4%EC%9A%B4%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"1 다운로드 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>node js</li>\n<li>vs code</li>\n</ul>\n<p>node.js 를 설치하면 npm을 이용할 수 있다.<br>\nnpm은 각종 웹 개발 라이브러리들을 쉽게 이용할 수 있게 도와주는 패키지 매니저다. (yarn도 마찬가지)<br>\nnpm으로 vue cli를 설치한다. (vue 프로젝트 생성을 빠르게 도와주는 라이브러리)</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-vuecli-설치\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. vue/CLI 설치<a href=\"#2-vuecli-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"2 vuecli 설치 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>vs code 터미널에<br>\n<strong>npm instsall -g @vue/cli</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-g</span> @vue/cli\r\n<span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-g</span> @vue/cli@4.5.11</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><strong>맥북</strong>의 경우 명령어 앞에 <strong>sudo</strong>(admin 권한) 명령어를 붙여주면 정상 동작한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">sudo</span> <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-g</span> @vue/cli</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><strong>npm 에서 에러가 날 경우</strong><br>\nyarn 설치 후, 윈도우 재부팅, 후 터미널에서 yarn을 설치한다.<br>\n(맥은 터미널 아무데나 열고 npm install -g yarn 하면 됨)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">yarn</span> global <span class=\"token function\">add</span> @vue/cli</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 705px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/38bb61e0eeaf2727d546c8a45049e7b1/f8d10/image01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image