an\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 679px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/a96cc/image08.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 102.08333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/a59e9/image08.webp 192w,\n/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/0ca9f/image08.webp 384w,\n/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/6943c/image08.webp 679w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 679px) 100vw, 679px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/3b721/image08.png 192w,\n/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/66595/image08.png 384w,\n/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/a96cc/image08.png 679w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 679px) 100vw, 679px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/709c6557dc70e9d00b13e39300b1a635/a96cc/image08.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>설치 완료</em></p>\n<p>vue 프로젝트 생성이 완료되면, 지정했던 폴더 안에 ‘프로젝트명’으로 폴더가 생성되어 있다.<br>\n‘프로젝트명’ 폴더를  vs code에서 연다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"설치에-에러가-날-경우\" style=\"position:relative;\">설치에 에러가 날 경우<a href=\"#%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98%EC%97%90-%EC%97%90%EB%9F%AC%EA%B0%80-%EB%82%A0-%EA%B2%BD%EC%9A%B0\" aria-label=\"설치에 에러가 날 경우 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-npm-yarn-명령어-입력하자마자-에러가-날-경우\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. npm, yarn 명령어 입력하자마자 에러가 날 경우<a href=\"#1-npm-yarn-%EB%AA%85%EB%A0%B9%EC%96%B4-%EC%9E%85%EB%A0%A5%ED%95%98%EC%9E%90%EB%A7%88%EC%9E%90-%EC%97%90%EB%9F%AC%EA%B0%80-%EB%82%A0-%EA%B2%BD%EC%9A%B0\" aria-label=\"1 npm yarn 명령어 입력하자마자 에러가 날 경우 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>설치가 잘 되다가 갑자기 중간에 빨간게 뜨며 에러가 나는 대부분의 경우는<br>\n99% 확률로 node js가 최신버전이 아닐 경우입니다.<br>\nnode js 삭제 후 다른버전을 받아서 다시 시도한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-맥에서-permission이-없어요-권한이-없어요-에러가-뜬다면\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 맥에서 permission이 없어요, 권한이 없어요 에러가 뜬다면<a href=\"#2-%EB%A7%A5%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-permission%EC%9D%B4-%EC%97%86%EC%96%B4%EC%9A%94-%EA%B6%8C%ED%95%9C%EC%9D%B4-%EC%97%86%EC%96%B4%EC%9A%94-%EC%97%90%EB%9F%AC%EA%B0%80-%EB%9C%AC%EB%8B%A4%EB%A9%B4\" aria-label=\"2 맥에서 permission이 없어요 권한이 없어요 에러가 뜬다면 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>직관적인 해결책은 그냥 npm이나 yarn 쓸때 앞에 sudo 라는 단어를 붙여주는것이다.<br>\n<strong>sudo npm install -g @vue/cli</strong><br>\n하지만 sudo는 임시방편일 뿐..</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">npm</span> ERR<span class=\"token operator\">!</span> syscall access\r\n<span class=\"token function\">npm</span> ERR<span class=\"token operator\">!</span> Error: EACCES: permission denied, access <span class=\"token string\">'/user/local/lib/node_modules'</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>예를 들어 위와 같은 에러가 뜰 경우<br>\n/user/local/lib/node_modules 라는 폴더에 수정권한을 주면 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">sudo</span> <span class=\"token function\">chown</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-R</span> 맥북유저이름: 위에뜬경로\r\n<span class=\"token function\">sudo</span> <span class=\"token function\">chown</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-R</span> <span class=\"token environment constant\">$USER</span> 위에뜬경로</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>위 둘 중 하나를 입력하면 대부분 해결된다.<br>\n맥북유저이름은 터미널에 whoami 입력하면 나온다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-윈도우-powershell-에서-빨간글씨로-보안오류가-뜰-경우\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 윈도우 Powershell 에서 빨간글씨로 ‘보안오류’가 뜰 경우<a href=\"#3-%EC%9C%88%EB%8F%84%EC%9A%B0-powershell-%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%B9%A8%EA%B0%84%EA%B8%80%EC%94%A8%EB%A1%9C-%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88%EC%98%A4%EB%A5%98%EA%B0%80-%EB%9C%B0-%EA%B2%BD%EC%9A%B0\" aria-label=\"3 윈도우 powershell 에서 빨간글씨로 보안오류가 뜰 경우 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>“허가되지 않은 스크립트 입니다 …” 에러가 뜨면<br>\n윈도우 검색메뉴(돋보기) - Powershell 검색 - 우클릭 - 관리자권한으로 실행한 뒤</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">Set-ExecutionPolicy Unrestricted</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>그대로 복사해서 입력한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/75b2d4ad2e4d272381e6b5548b08c9b6/4ec94/image09.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 28.645833333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0;